{"seq":1,"slug":"module-system","title":"Module System 模块系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/packages-and-modules/module-system","wordCount":1004,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"module-system-模块系统\">Module System 模块系统</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Go Module 是 Go 1.11 引入、Go 1.16 默认启用的依赖管理系统。一个 Module 是一组相关 Go 包的集合，以 <code>go.mod</code> 文件为根，定义了模块路径和依赖关系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;Module 结构&quot;&#10;        MOD[go.mod&lt;br/&gt;模块声明+依赖]&#10;        SUM[go.sum&lt;br/&gt;依赖校验和]&#10;        SRC[源代码&lt;br/&gt;.go 文件]&#10;        VND[vendor/&lt;br/&gt;本地依赖副本]&#10;    end&#10;    MOD --&gt; SRC&#10;    SUM --&gt; MOD&#10;    VND -.-&gt;|可选| MOD\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"Module 结构\"\n        MOD[go.mod&lt;br/&gt;模块声明+依赖]\n        SUM[go.sum&lt;br/&gt;依赖校验和]\n        SRC[源代码&lt;br/&gt;.go 文件]\n        VND[vendor/&lt;br/&gt;本地依赖副本]\n    end\n    MOD --&gt; SRC\n    SUM --&gt; MOD\n    VND -.-&gt;|可选| MOD</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Module</td>\n<td>包的集合，有版本</td>\n<td><code>github.com/user/project</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Package</td>\n<td>同目录下的 .go 文件集合</td>\n<td><code>github.com/user/project/pkg/auth</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Module Path</td>\n<td>模块的唯一标识</td>\n<td><code>github.com/user/project</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Module Version</td>\n<td>语义化版本号</td>\n<td><code>v1.2.3</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"go-mod-文件\">go.mod 文件</h2><p><code>go.mod</code> 是模块的核心配置文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"module github.com/myorg/myapp&#10;&#10;go 1.22&#10;&#10;require (&#10;\tgithub.com/gin-gonic/gin v1.9.1&#10;\tgithub.com/redis/go-redis/v9 v9.4.0&#10;\tgo.uber.org/zap v1.27.0&#10;\tgoogle.golang.org/grpc v1.62.0&#10;)&#10;&#10;require (&#10;\tgithub.com/cespare/xxhash/v2 v2.2.0 // indirect&#10;\tgithub.com/dgryski/go-rendezvous v0.0.0-20200823014737-9f7001d12a5f // indirect&#10;\tgolang.org/x/net v0.21.0 // indirect&#10;)&#10;&#10;retract (&#10;\tv1.0.0 // 包含严重 bug&#10;\t[v1.1.0, v1.2.0] // 不推荐使用&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">module github.com</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">myorg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">go</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.22</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">require (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tgithub.com</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gonic</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gin v1.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tgithub.com</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">redis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/go-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">redis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">v9 v9.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tgo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.uber.org</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">zap v1.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">27.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tgoogle.golang.org</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grpc v1.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">62.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">require (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tgithub.com</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cespare</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">xxhash</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">v2 v2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // indirect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tgithub.com</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dgryski</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/go-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rendezvous v0.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20200823014737</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#B31D28;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#FDAEB7;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">9f7001d12a5f</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // indirect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tgolang.org</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">net v0.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">21.0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // indirect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">retract (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tv1.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 包含严重 bug</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t[v1.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, v1.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不推荐使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指令</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>module</code></td>\n<td>声明模块路径</td>\n<td><code>module github.com/user/app</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>go</code></td>\n<td>指定 Go 最低版本</td>\n<td><code>go 1.22</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>require</code></td>\n<td>声明依赖及版本</td>\n<td><code>require github.com/pkg/errors v0.9.1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>replace</code></td>\n<td>替换依赖路径/版本</td>\n<td><code>replace old =&gt; new v1.0.0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exclude</code></td>\n<td>排除特定版本</td>\n<td><code>exclude github.com/pkg/lib v1.1.0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>retract</code></td>\n<td>撤回已发布的版本</td>\n<td><code>retract v1.0.0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>toolchain</code></td>\n<td>指定工具链版本（Go 1.21+）</td>\n<td><code>toolchain go1.22.0</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"go-sum-文件\">go.sum 文件</h2><p><code>go.sum</code> 记录每个依赖的加密哈希值，确保构建的可复现性和安全性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"github.com/gin-gonic/gin v1.9.1 h1:4idEAncQnU5cB7BeOkPtxjfCSye0AAm1R0RVIqFPSA=&#10;github.com/gin-gonic/gin v1.9.1/go.mod h1:hPrL/0KcuKfyOTQFB4sBVY...=\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>github.com/gin-gonic/gin v1.9.1 h1:4idEAncQnU5cB7BeOkPtxjfCSye0AAm1R0RVIqFPSA=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>github.com/gin-gonic/gin v1.9.1/go.mod h1:hPrL/0KcuKfyOTQFB4sBVY...=</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每行格式：<code>模块路径 版本 算法:哈希值</code></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件</th>\n<th>是否提交到 VCS</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>go.mod</td>\n<td>✅ 必须</td>\n<td>声明依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>go.sum</td>\n<td>✅ 必须</td>\n<td>校验依赖完整性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>vendor/</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>本地依赖缓存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"语义版本-semver\">语义版本（Semver）</h2><p>Go Module 强制使用语义化版本控制：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    V[&quot;v1.2.3&quot;] --&gt; MAJOR[&quot;1 = Major&lt;br/&gt;不兼容变更&quot;]&#10;    V --&gt; MINOR[&quot;2 = Minor&lt;br/&gt;向后兼容新功能&quot;]&#10;    V --&gt; PATCH[&quot;3 = Patch&lt;br/&gt;向后兼容修复&quot;]\">graph LR\n    V[\"v1.2.3\"] --&gt; MAJOR[\"1 = Major&lt;br/&gt;不兼容变更\"]\n    V --&gt; MINOR[\"2 = Minor&lt;br/&gt;向后兼容新功能\"]\n    V --&gt; PATCH[\"3 = Patch&lt;br/&gt;向后兼容修复\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本变更</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>Go Module 规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>v0.x.x</td>\n<td>不稳定，API 可随时变</td>\n<td>导入路径无后缀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>v1.x.x</td>\n<td>稳定，遵守兼容性承诺</td>\n<td>导入路径无后缀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>v2.x.x</td>\n<td>不兼容变更</td>\n<td>导入路径必须加 <code>/v2</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>v3+.x.x</td>\n<td>更多不兼容变更</td>\n<td>导入路径必须加 <code>/vN</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>v2+ 导入路径规则：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"package main&#10;&#10;import (&#10;\t&quot;github.com/myorg/mylib&quot;&#10;\tmylib2 &quot;github.com/myorg/mylib/v2&quot;&#10;\tmylib3 &quot;github.com/myorg/mylib/v3&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10;\tmylib.DoSomething()&#10;\tmylib2.DoSomethingV2()&#10;\tmylib3.DoSomethingV3()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">github.com/myorg/mylib</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tmylib2 </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">github.com/myorg/mylib/v2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tmylib3 </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">github.com/myorg/mylib/v3</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tmylib.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DoSomething</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tmylib2.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DoSomethingV2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tmylib3.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DoSomethingV3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>**伪版本号（Pseudo-version）**用于引用未打 tag 的提交：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"v0.0.0-20240301120000-abcdef123456\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>v0.0.0-20240301120000-abcdef123456</span></span></code></pre></div><p>格式：<code>vX.Y.Z-yyyymmddhhmmss-commithash</code></p>\n<h2 id=\"module-代理\">Module 代理</h2><p>Go Module 代理加速依赖下载并提供不可变性保证：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Dev as 开发者&#10;    participant Proxy as Module 代理&#10;    participant Origin as 源仓库&#10;    participant SumDB as 校验和数据库&#10;&#10;    Dev-&gt;&gt;Proxy: go get github.com/pkg/lib&#10;    Proxy-&gt;&gt;Origin: 首次获取源码&#10;    Origin--&gt;&gt;Proxy: 返回源码&#10;    Proxy-&gt;&gt;SumDB: 验证校验和&#10;    SumDB--&gt;&gt;Proxy: 校验通过&#10;    Proxy--&gt;&gt;Dev: 返回模块&#10;    Dev-&gt;&gt;Proxy: 再次获取(缓存命中)&#10;    Proxy--&gt;&gt;Dev: 直接返回(快速)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Dev as 开发者\n    participant Proxy as Module 代理\n    participant Origin as 源仓库\n    participant SumDB as 校验和数据库\n\n    Dev-&gt;&gt;Proxy: go get github.com/pkg/lib\n    Proxy-&gt;&gt;Origin: 首次获取源码\n    Origin--&gt;&gt;Proxy: 返回源码\n    Proxy-&gt;&gt;SumDB: 验证校验和\n    SumDB--&gt;&gt;Proxy: 校验通过\n    Proxy--&gt;&gt;Dev: 返回模块\n    Dev-&gt;&gt;Proxy: 再次获取(缓存命中)\n    Proxy--&gt;&gt;Dev: 直接返回(快速)</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"go env GOPROXY&#10;# 默认: https://proxy.golang.org,direct&#10;&#10;# 设置国内代理&#10;go env -w GOPROXY=https://goproxy.cn,direct&#10;&#10;# 多代理回退&#10;go env -w GOPROXY=https://goproxy.cn,https://proxy.golang.org,direct\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> env</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GOPROXY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 默认: https://proxy.golang.org,direct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 设置国内代理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> env</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GOPROXY=https://goproxy.cn,direct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 多代理回退</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> env</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GOPROXY=https://goproxy.cn,https://proxy.golang.org,direct</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环境变量</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>GOPROXY</code></td>\n<td>模块代理地址</td>\n<td><code>https://proxy.golang.org,direct</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GONOSUMCHECK</code></td>\n<td>跳过校验和检查的模块</td>\n<td>空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GONOSUMDB</code></td>\n<td>不经过校验和数据库的模块</td>\n<td>空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GOPRIVATE</code></td>\n<td>私有模块模式（同时设置 GONOSUMDB 和 GONOSUMCHECK）</td>\n<td>空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GONOPROXY</code></td>\n<td>不使用代理的模块</td>\n<td>空</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"私有-module\">私有 Module</h2><p>对于企业内部的私有模块，需要特殊配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"go env -w GOPRIVATE=github.com/myorg/*,gitlab.mycompany.com/*&#10;&#10;go env -w GONOSUMDB=github.com/myorg/*&#10;go env -w GONOPROXY=github.com/myorg/*\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> env</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GOPRIVATE=github.com/myorg/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,gitlab.mycompany.com/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> env</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GONOSUMDB=github.com/myorg/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> env</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GONOPROXY=github.com/myorg/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">*</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Git 认证配置：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config --global url.&quot;https://oauth2:${TOKEN}@gitlab.mycompany.com&quot;.insteadOf &quot;https://gitlab.mycompany.com&quot;&#10;&#10;git config --global url.&quot;ssh://git@github.com/&quot;.insteadOf &quot;https://github.com/&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> url.\"https://oauth2:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}@gitlab.mycompany.com\".insteadOf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"https://gitlab.mycompany.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> url.\"ssh://git@github.com/\".insteadOf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"https://github.com/\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>在 .netrc 中配置认证：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"machine github.com&#10;login oauth2&#10;password ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxx&#10;&#10;machine gitlab.mycompany.com&#10;login oauth2&#10;password glpat-xxxxxxxxxxxx\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>machine github.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>login oauth2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>password ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>machine gitlab.mycompany.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>login oauth2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>password glpat-xxxxxxxxxxxx</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"workspace-模式\">Workspace 模式</h2><p>Go 1.18 引入 Workspace 模式，允许同时开发多个模块：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;Workspace&quot;&#10;        GW[go.work]&#10;        M1[module-a/go.mod]&#10;        M2[module-b/go.mod]&#10;        M3[shared-lib/go.mod]&#10;    end&#10;    GW --&gt; M1&#10;    GW --&gt; M2&#10;    GW --&gt; M3&#10;    M1 -.-&gt;|依赖| M3&#10;    M2 -.-&gt;|依赖| M3\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"Workspace\"\n        GW[go.work]\n        M1[module-a/go.mod]\n        M2[module-b/go.mod]\n        M3[shared-lib/go.mod]\n    end\n    GW --&gt; M1\n    GW --&gt; M2\n    GW --&gt; M3\n    M1 -.-&gt;|依赖| M3\n    M2 -.-&gt;|依赖| M3</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"mkdir workspace &amp;&amp; cd workspace&#10;git clone https://github.com/myorg/module-a&#10;git clone https://github.com/myorg/module-b&#10;git clone https://github.com/myorg/shared-lib&#10;&#10;go work init ./module-a ./module-b ./shared-lib\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> workspace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> workspace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/myorg/module-a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/myorg/module-b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/myorg/shared-lib</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> work</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./module-a</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./module-b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./shared-lib</span></span></code></pre></div><p>生成的 <code>go.work</code> 文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"go 1.22&#10;&#10;use (&#10;\t./module-a&#10;\t./module-b&#10;\t./shared-lib&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>go 1.22</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\t./module-a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\t./module-b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\t./shared-lib</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>go work init</code></td>\n<td>初始化 workspace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>go work use ./path</code></td>\n<td>添加模块到 workspace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>go work sync</code></td>\n<td>同步 workspace 中各模块的依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>go work edit</code></td>\n<td>编辑 go.work 文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>注意事项：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>go.work</code> 不提交到 VCS</td>\n<td>它是本地开发工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>workspace 内的 replace 自动生效</td>\n<td>无需在 go.mod 中 replace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI/CD 不使用 workspace</td>\n<td>用 go.mod 的正式依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模块初始化与发布\">模块初始化与发布</h2><p><strong>初始化新模块：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"mkdir myapp &amp;&amp; cd myapp&#10;go mod init github.com/myorg/myapp\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mod</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> github.com/myorg/myapp</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>发布模块：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git tag v1.0.0&#10;git push origin v1.0.0&#10;&#10;git tag v2.0.0&#10;git push origin v2.0.0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v1.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v1.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v2.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v2.0.0</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"package main&#10;&#10;import (&#10;\t&quot;fmt&quot;&#10;\t&quot;os/exec&quot;&#10;\t&quot;strings&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;func getModuleVersion() string {&#10;\tcmd := exec.Command(&quot;go&quot;, &quot;list&quot;, &quot;-m&quot;, &quot;-json&quot;)&#10;\tout, err := cmd.Output()&#10;\tif err != nil {&#10;\t\treturn &quot;unknown&quot;&#10;\t}&#10;\treturn strings.TrimSpace(string(out))&#10;}&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10;\tfmt.Println(getModuleVersion())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fmt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">os/exec</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">strings</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getModuleVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tcmd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"go\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"list\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-m\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tout, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cmd.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\t\treturn</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"unknown\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\treturn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strings.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TrimSpace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(out))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getModuleVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常用-module-命令速查\">常用 Module 命令速查</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>go mod init &lt;path&gt;</code></td>\n<td>初始化模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>go mod tidy</code></td>\n<td>添加缺失依赖，移除未使用依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>go mod download</code></td>\n<td>下载依赖到本地缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>go mod verify</code></td>\n<td>验证依赖的校验和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>go mod graph</code></td>\n<td>打印依赖图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>go mod why &lt;pkg&gt;</code></td>\n<td>解释为何需要某依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>go mod edit -json</code></td>\n<td>JSON 格式输出 go.mod</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>go mod vendor</code></td>\n<td>将依赖复制到 vendor/</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>go list -m all</code></td>\n<td>列出所有依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>go list -m -versions &lt;mod&gt;</code></td>\n<td>列出模块所有版本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"常见陷阱\">常见陷阱</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>忘记提交 go.sum</strong>：缺失 <code>go.sum</code> 会导致 CI 上 <code>go mod verify</code> 失败，构建不可复现。</li>\n<li><strong>v2+ 模块路径漏写后缀</strong>：不兼容升级时导入路径必须带 <code>/v2</code>，漏写会让新版本被当作 v1 的同一个模块解析。</li>\n<li><strong>手改 go.mod 版本</strong>：直接编辑版本号而不跑 <code>go mod tidy</code>，会让 require 与间接依赖不一致。</li>\n<li><strong>把 go.work 提交到仓库</strong>：<code>go.work</code> 是本地开发工具，提交后所有协作者会被强制进入 workspace 模式。</li>\n<li><strong>私有模块未配置 GOPRIVATE</strong>：未设置 GOPRIVATE 时私有模块会尝试走公共代理并经校验和数据库，导致拉取失败或校验错误。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Go Module 系统是 Go 生态的基石，理解 go.mod、语义版本、代理和 workspace 对日常开发和项目管理至关重要。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>知识点</th>\n<th>核心要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>go.mod</td>\n<td>模块声明、依赖管理、replace/exclude</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>go.sum</td>\n<td>依赖校验和，确保可复现构建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义版本</td>\n<td>Major 不兼容、Minor 新功能、Patch 修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>v2+ 规则</td>\n<td>导入路径必须包含 /vN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Module 代理</td>\n<td>GOPROXY 加速下载、提供不可变性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私有 Module</td>\n<td>GOPRIVATE 跳过代理和校验和检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Workspace</td>\n<td>go.work 支持多模块并行开发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Module System 模块系统","id":"module-system-模块系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"go.mod 文件","id":"go-mod-文件"},{"level":2,"text":"go.sum 文件","id":"go-sum-文件"},{"level":2,"text":"语义版本（Semver）","id":"语义版本-semver"},{"level":2,"text":"Module 代理","id":"module-代理"},{"level":2,"text":"私有 Module","id":"私有-module"},{"level":2,"text":"Workspace 模式","id":"workspace-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"模块初始化与发布","id":"模块初始化与发布"},{"level":2,"text":"常用 Module 命令速查","id":"常用-module-命令速查"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱","id":"常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Constraint Patterns 约束模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/interfaces-and-generics/constraint-patterns"},"next":{"title":"Dependency Management 依赖管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/packages-and-modules/dependency-management"}}